{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Tales of Tuscany?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Tuscany is a <strong>Choose-Your-Own-Adventure RPG </strong>which uses<strong>\u00a0Fast-Paced Bullethell Action </strong>in battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/d9b209b1aaaaea3decb9eb26fe15ff28.apng?t=1771422710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/d9b209b1aaaaea3decb9eb26fe15ff28.poster.avif?t=1771422710\" class=\"bb_img\" width=388 height=59 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home has been obliterated by <strong>The Evil Vizard Thunder Goober</strong> for his own personal entertainment...\u00a0<strong>Play as Lambypoo</strong> and adventure through the shaken-up land of <strong>Tuscany</strong>, either <strong>recruiting enemies to fight alongside you</strong> or <strong>defeating enemies for their EXP\u00a0</strong>in your efforts to <strong>save your cousins and rebuild your village</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/5e82b698c68264d62a693079fca33160.poster.avif?t=1771422710\" width=1170 height=155 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/5e82b698c68264d62a693079fca33160.webm?t=1771422710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/0e263a5528c0e7aa05a63f99115447ee.avif?t=1771422710\" width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose your own adventure! Skip <strong>huuuge, really fun sidequests</strong>, spend <strong>10,000 hours fishing</strong>, and even take on <strong>whole alternate routes</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless hilarious and &quot;provocative&quot; side quests where you'll meet lots of <strong>weird characters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>&quot;Baaa&quot; button</strong>\u00a0to <strong>destroy cars and buildings</strong>, <strong>explode enemies</strong> in the overworld, and other things!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/998c80e4e10d4fb359187afe53ba5631.avif?t=1771422710\" width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies in <strong>fast-paced bullet-hell battles</strong>, featuring colorful and imaginative attacks. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clever ways to <strong>DEFAT or BEFRIEND</strong> your enemy utilizing minigames such as a <strong>home run derby</strong>, <strong>carving pumpkins</strong>, <strong>surfing at the public pool</strong>, <strong>smacking flies with a fly swatter</strong>... You get the idea...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>INSANE CHALLENGES</strong> to face, and you can mix up your gameplay with <strong>Challenge Modifiers</strong> like <strong>1HP mode</strong>, <strong>No Friends Mode</strong>, and others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/10eb83132f849ffdd39cc27a2314da3c.avif?t=1771422710\" width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>BEFRIENDED enemies to your team</strong> to play as, using their individualized stats as well as their\u00a0<strong>BURST skills</strong> that will change your approach to battling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shiny hunt</strong>\u00a0your friends and find rare, alternate colored versions of <strong>every character you can add to your team</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you complete a game, you'll get a postcard called a <strong>RHAPSODY</strong>. Collect these and trade them with friends <strong>around the world</strong>... Each Rhapsody is completely unique to the playthrough it came from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of Challenge Modifiers to create awesome challenge runs with, one of them even replaces all of the game's text with <strong>WINGDINGS???</strong> Then, show off your accolades on your <strong>Rhapsodies</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/69c5855fd6727e6a4225688846583661.avif?t=1771422710\" width=1560 height=305 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect your Twitch.tv account while playing to <strong>connect your game to your livestream</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chatters will appear in your world</strong> as their own Lambypoos, with colors + armors that are consistent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers can <strong>redeem channel points to do funny stuff</strong>, mess with you, or help you as you play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polls will periodically come up</strong> where viewers can vote on a plethora of outcomes which will change the course of your gameplay... you can turn these options on and off, of course!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/c033601cb11e1c931de12962bbfef69d.poster.avif?t=1771422710\" width=634 height=423 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/c033601cb11e1c931de12962bbfef69d.webm?t=1771422710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/702e072d786cb6d20a502097c8539374.avif?t=1771422710\" width=600 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Tuscany is not meant to <i>just</i> be a singe-player-game, but also serve as a communication tool to share your experiences and compare/contrast amongst your friends, and even trade valuable keepsakes if you really trust each other.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/d5b1ef8652e692621bb2cae293e43527.avif?t=1771422710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras_big/d5b1ef8652e692621bb2cae293e43527.webp?t=1771422710 width=1560 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will earn a different <strong>Rhapsody</strong> each time you complete the game - there are loads of stickers to unlock through your adventures and your Rhapsody will change based on your decisions throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/a7aa4f5ac9781f4c8b1ae66c22fd87c7.avif?t=1771422710\" width=600 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes it's so good. You can join a <strong>multi level marketing scheme</strong>, <strong>roll around a spicy dung-beetle-ball</strong>, <strong>get a corporate job</strong>, <strong>blow up expensive cars</strong>, <strong>shoot your less important friends out of cannons so they explode</strong>, and there's even a <strong>public poo</strong>l. I know I mentioned that before but seriously who doesn't like the public pool it's the best place on earth...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334170?t=1771422710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771422710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/e0399e3120c039d726f2b790ff865b4525ef4860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771422710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/e0399e3120c039d726f2b790ff865b4525ef4860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771422710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Tales of Tuscany?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Tuscany is a <strong>Choose-Your-Own-Adventure RPG </strong>which uses<strong>\u00a0Fast-Paced Bullethell Action </strong>in battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/d9b209b1aaaaea3decb9eb26fe15ff28.apng?t=1771422710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/d9b209b1aaaaea3decb9eb26fe15ff28.poster.avif?t=1771422710\" class=\"bb_img\" width=388 height=59 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home has been obliterated by <strong>The Evil Vizard Thunder Goober</strong> for his own