?</strong> Then, show off your accolades on your <strong>Rhapsodies</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/69c5855fd6727e6a4225688846583661.avif?t=1771422710\" width=1560 height=305 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect your Twitch.tv account while playing to <strong>connect your game to your livestream</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chatters will appear in your world</strong> as their own Lambypoos, with colors + armors that are consistent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers can <strong>redeem channel points to do funny stuff</strong>, mess with you, or help you as you play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polls will periodically come up</strong> where viewers can vote on a plethora of outcomes which will change the course of your gameplay... you can turn these options on and off, of course!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/c033601cb11e1c931de12962bbfef69d.poster.avif?t=1771422710\" width=634 height=423 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/c033601cb11e1c931de12962bbfef69d.webm?t=1771422710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/702e072d786cb6d20a502097c8539374.avif?t=1771422710\" width=600 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Tuscany is not meant to <i>just</i> be a singe-player-game, but also serve as a communication tool to share your experiences and compare/contrast amongst your friends, and even trade valuable keepsakes if you really trust each other.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/d5b1ef8652e692621bb2cae293e43527.avif?t=1771422710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras_big/d5b1ef8652e692621bb2cae293e43527.webp?t=1771422710 width=1560 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will earn a different <strong>Rhapsody</strong> each time you complete the game - there are loads of stickers to unlock through your adventures and your Rhapsody will change based on your decisions throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/extras/a7aa4f5ac9781f4c8b1ae66c22fd87c7.avif?t=1771422710\" width=600 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes it's so good. You can join a <strong>multi level marketing scheme</strong>, <strong>roll around a spicy dung-beetle-ball</strong>, <strong>get a corporate job</strong>, <strong>blow up expensive cars</strong>, <strong>shoot your less important friends out of cannons so they explode</strong>, and there's even a <strong>public poo</strong>l. I know I mentioned that before but seriously who doesn't like the public pool it's the best place on earth...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["Nico Papalia"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334170/0c3b9140f897ece98ff3dc06d5feb16f7f8b0fd9/header.jpg?t=1771422710","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3334170/955888343/b170659490dfc08fe71cd6460748e91cbe386d55/1758650537/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758653636","